{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月18日 10:38 星期三</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>港鐵於今早8時46分指，由於香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛。港島線列車服務受阻，整體行車時間一度延長5至8分鐘。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>至近10時36分，港鐵指信號設備故障已修復，港島線列車服務陸續恢復正常。</p><h2> </h2></div><p>相關字詞﹕港鐵 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T03:24:56.903768+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T02:38:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T04:37:24.694211+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T03:18:23.792077+00:00","content_hash":"2bdf17f52060ad1cf2ee254e77b75296aefbc4f38b1dc6979c8cef947f38975b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}